  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Document updates and expands the original 2018 project, reflecting changes in Kazakhstan&#x2019;s pharmaceutical sector and the growing cooperation between UNDP and the Government. It focuses on strengthening procurement and supply management systems, particularly through enhancing the capacity of &#x201c;SK-Pharmacy,&#x201d; to ensure efficient, transparent, and cost-effective access to essential medicines and equipment. The initiative aims to improve public access to high-quality medicines, generate s</narrative>
  </description>
