    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">All planned shipments are organized in line with approved Procurement and Budget Plan; the goods are checked by quantity and quality and transferred to &#x2018;&#x2019;SK-Pharmacy&quot;, LLP.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Constantly increasing incidence of Hep C and other socially significant diseases requires bigger quantities of medicines for broader coverage of infected population. National medical facilities lack necessary medicines to provide effective uninterrupted treatment of population of RK diagnosed with socially significant diseases, including HCV. Single distributor, &#x201c;SK-Pharmacy&quot;, LLP, requires capacity building support in the field of procurement of necessary medicines and medical supplies to ensure effective coverage.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To effect international/national procurement of medicines (anti-HeC and antineoplastic medicines) for 2021 according to the Annual Work Plan for 2021.
2) To transfer medicines to &#x201c;SK-Pharmacy , LLP upon their arrival to Almaty International Airport after their customs clearance managed by &#x201c;SK-Pharmacy ,LLP and respective quality/quantity check.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Procurement of medicine Irinotecan for 2021 was processed successfully according to the Procurement and annual work plan. PO #UNDP1-GPH264Z001 &#x2013; delivered in March 2021, PO #UNDP1-GPH367Z001 &#x2013; delivered in December 2021. 
2. All medicines were transferred to &#x201c;SK-Pharmacy , LLP (March &#x2013; December 2021).</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To effect international/national procurement of medicines (anticancer medicines, Sof/Dac) for 2020 according to the Annual Work Plan for 2020.
2) To transfer medicines to &#x201c;SK-Pharmacy , LLP upon their arrival to Almaty International Airport after their customs clearance managed by &#x201c;SK-Pharmacy ,LLP and respective quality/quantity check.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is in the process of realization, attaining the planned results and implementing all the planned activities:
&#x2022;	Procurement of Sofosbuvir/Daclatasvir under the Contract (PO) #KAZ10-0000027522 &#x2013; 5,953 packs of Sofosbuvir and Daclatasvir (each) for 1,984 patients were delivered and transferred to the final recipients. 
&#x2022;	Procurement of Sofosbuvir/Daclatasvir under the Contract (PO) UNDP1-GPH241B001 -19,534 packs of Sofosbuvir and Daclatasvir (each) for 6,511 patients, is in process. The goods are expected by the end of December 2020.
&#x2022;	Procurement of Triptorelin under the Contracts (POs) #UNDP1-GPH142Z001 and #UNDP1- GPH142Z002, 4,326 vials and 1,076 vials, respectively. Full quantities were delivered and transferred to the final recipients.
&#x2022;	Procurement of Bortezomib under the Contracts (POs) #UNDP1-GPH126Z002 and #UNDP1-GPH331Z001, 11,318 vials and 707 vials, respectively. Full quantities were delivered and transferred to the final recipients.
&#x2022;	Procurement of Irinotecan under the Contract (PO) #UNDP1-GPH164B002 &#x2013; 8,130 vials. Medicines were delivered and transferred to the final recipients.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
